      8 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">اصتقرت النَّارُ</span></b>  and 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">اصطقرت</span></b>  <i>The fire became
lighted</i> or <i>kindle; burned, burned up, burned
brightly</i> or <i>fiercely, blazed,</i> or <i>flamed;</i> (M, K;)
as also ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تصقّرت</span></b> . (K.)

